    <string name="quran_text_source_message">This app bundles the official Uthmanic Quran text (Hafs reading, fully vowel-marked) from the fawazahmed0/quran-api repository, with its companion metadata carrying the surah names, the 604 Madani page boundaries and the 30 juzs. The text is reflowed for the screen and never altered; every ayah is closed by its built-in end-of-ayah glyph. The complete notice is included with the app source. Visit the repository for updates.</string>
